  "body": "Tucked away in a tightly held St Heliers pocket, this single-level brick and tile home offers easy, private living just moments from the bays.\r\n\r\nCathedral ceilings and a large windows fill the open-plan living and dining area with light. The modern kitchen sits at its heart, ready for everyday cooking and relaxed entertaining. Outside, a lush, fully hedged garden wraps around the home, creating a private green retreat that needs very little upkeep.\r\n\r\n* Single-level brick and tile home with no stairs and no fuss\r\n* Two well-proportioned bedrooms, with built-in wardrobes in the primary\r\n* Sun-drenched living and dining area with vaulted ceilings\r\n* Easy indoor-outdoor flow to a sun-drenched patio and garden\r\n* Modern kitchen with generous bench space and storage\r\n* Renovated bathroom with bath and separate shower, plus a separate WC\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Private, established garden with lawn and mature planting\r\n* Single garage with internal access\r\n* Moments from St Heliers village, the beach, cafes and the waterfront along Tamaki Drive\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing without compromise, buying your first home or wanting a lock-up-and-leave base in the bays, this is a home that simply makes sense. Get in touch now to arrange a private viewing, or I look forward to meeting you at the Open Homes.",
